<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Regal Cinemas cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Regal Cinemas cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilliard Lyons analyst Jeffrey Thomison said Tuesday he cut his rating on Regal Cinemas Inc to hold from a buy, following a &quot;substantial price appreciation over the past several months.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Regal shares were off 1/8 at 32-1/2.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Thomison said he believes that earnings from Regal Cinemas and high expectations from the summer film season are mostly reflected in the current stock price.</p>
<p>-- He said he advises holding the shares for long-term capital appreciation potential.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
